<!--
================================================================================
  CARDINALITY SUMMARY
================================================================================
  putEvent root      = 1
  controlHeader      = 1
  patient            = 1
  patient.identification = 1..2  (allow 1 or 2 ID blocks — NRIC + passport, etc.)
  patient.contactDetails.address = 0..*  (one MAIN, plus optional OTHER)
  patient.contactDetails.phone   = 0..*  (one HOME / MOBILE / WORK each, max)
  patient.nextOfKin   = 0..*
  event              = 0..1     (Mandatory grouping; absent only for non-Clinical msgTypes)
  → For multiple patients/visits, send multiple separate XML documents
    (one HTTPS POST per message).

================================================================================
  MESSAGE TYPE VARIATIONS
================================================================================
  Clinical (this example): controlHeader + patient + event. msgType=Clinical.
  Administrative:          controlHeader + patient (no event). msgType=Administrative.
  Cancel:                  controlHeader + patient (no event). msgType=Cancel.
  Merge:                   controlHeader + patient with patientMergeType. msgType=Merge.

================================================================================
  DATA TYPE GLOSSARY
================================================================================
  String(N)      varchar, max N characters
  String(CLOB)   character large object (no fixed maximum; for free text descriptions)
  Long(N)        long integer up to N digits
  Date           ISO 8601 date    e.g.  1987-12-27
  DateTime       ISO 8601 datetime e.g.  2026-05-04T15:30:00+08:00
  Boolean(5)     "true" or "false" (max 5 chars)
  Grouping       XML element wrapper (no leaf value)
================================================================================
-->